{"version":"1.1.2","notes":"## 1.1.2 - 2026-10-08\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix the data upgrade failing on every launch with \"backup failed\" after a first upgrade attempt was interrupted: the pre-upgrade backup is now recaptured on retry, and the earlier backup is kept (#1833)\n- Fix Engine diagnostic logs going silent once the local log quota was full: the oldest log file is now removed to make room instead of dropping new records (#1833)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.1.2 - 2026-10-08\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复数据升级在第一次尝试被中断后，之后每次启动都提示“备份失败”的问题：重试时会重新生成升级前备份，并保留之前的备份 (#1833)\n- 修复本地日志配额写满后 Engine 诊断日志不再记录的问题：现在会删除最旧的日志文件腾出空间，而不是丢弃新记录 (#1833)","confirmation_required":false,"confirmation_description":null,"pub_date":"2026-10-09T02:19:36Z","platforms":{"linux-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.1.2/UniClipboard_1.1.2_amd64.AppImage"},"windows-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.1.2/UniClipboard_1.1.2_arm64-setup.exe"},"windows-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.1.2/UniClipboard_1.1.2_x64-setup.exe"},"darwin-aarch64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.1.2/UniClipboard_aarch64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"},"darwin-x86_64":{"signature":"","url":"https://release.uniclipboard.app/artifacts/v1.1.2/UniClipboard_x86_64-apple-darwin.app.tar.gz"}}}